  "text": "Reading feedback isn't available right now. You can still practise or return to the story.\n\nThe boy keeps the same repaired bird. Return to the people listening in Grandma’s garden.\n\nThe cushions are on the bench. Return to the gathering to let Grandma finish her account.\n\nPictures appear here after you take part in an event. You can return whenever you like.\n\nThis browser could not play the recording. You can read again or return to the story.\n\nRelease to place the object, or press Escape to return it to its previous position.\n\nThe earlier story ends. We return to the teller and listeners in Grandma’s garden.\n\nReturn to the gathering and hear Grandma ask Sol why he stopped bringing stories.\n\nReturn the boat to Pip’s launch before unloading. The same seed is still aboard.\n\nChoose Use this ending to select these exact words, or return to your draft.\n\nGrandma knows what Sol wants to share. Return to her to plan the gathering.\n\nReturn to the gathering and let Sol share his chosen version or open draft.\n\nChoose Use this plan to agree it with Grandma, or return to change it.\n\nReturn to the game, cross the river and talk to Grandma to deliver it.\n\nReturn to the gathering and share The Torn Wing with the people here.\n\nSol knows the plan. Return to Grandma after you have also told Mara.\n\nYour draft changed. Return to your ending and try the current words.\n\nMara knows the plan. Return to Grandma after you have also told Sol.\n\nReading help · Return to the same lantern when you are ready\n\nReturn to the riverbank or Grandma to watch the seed boat.\n\nReturn to the roof repair to choose and place the tile.\n\nConfirm this plan with Grandma, or return to change it.\n\nBoth ends are secure. Return to Pip, then walk across.\n\nReturn to Grandma and report the agreed arrangements.",
  "textSha256": "e4fe46da5d316f0056e2fbf51981a21728481680fd9eb2899ae655b0555c92f3",
